      <h1 data-id="pg077_n0003" class="adt-h2 font-bold text-neutral-800 mb-4 inline-block border-b-4 border-purple-400 pb-2">Njer&#xeb;zit q&#xeb; nuk harrohen</h1>
      <div class="mt-3">
