      <div class="flex-1 min-w-0">
        <div class="adt-body text-neutral-800 leading-relaxed space-y-2">
          <p>
            <span data-id="pg077_n0008">Mali shkon rregullisht te dentisti.</span>
            <span data-id="pg077_n0009">Shum&#xeb; i p&#xeb;lqen kur i sheh gjith&#xeb; ato mjete, me t&#xeb; cilat ndreqen dh&#xeb;mb&#xeb;t.</span>
            <span data-id="pg077_n0010">Edhe but&#xeb;sia e dentistit ka b&#xeb;r&#xeb; q&#xeb; Mali t&#xeb; kujdeset p&#xeb;r sh&#xeb;ndetin e dh&#xeb;mb&#xeb;ve me shum&#xeb; d&#xeb;shir&#xeb;.</span>
            <span data-id="pg077_n0011">Nj&#xeb; dit&#xeb;, ai e pyeti gjyshin:</span>
          </p>
          <p>
            <span data-id="pg077_n0012">- Gjysh, si ka qen&#xeb; mjek&#xeb;sia n&#xeb; koh&#xeb;n t&#xeb;nde?</span>
          </p>
          <p>
            <span data-id="pg077_n0013">- N&#xeb; koh&#xeb;n time, - tha gjyshi, - nuk kishte shum&#xeb; mjek&#xeb;.</span>
            <span data-id="pg077_n0014">Mjek&#xeb;t duhej t&#xeb; shkolloheshin n&#xeb; vende t&#xeb; tjera, sepse te ne nuk kishte shkolla.</span>
            <span data-id="pg077_n0015">Ata ishin shum&#xeb; t&#xeb; kujdessh&#xeb;m dhe sh&#xeb;ronin shum&#xeb; njer&#xeb;z, edhe pse nuk kishin mjetet q&#xeb; jan&#xeb; sot.</span>
            <span data-id="pg077_n0016">E sot ka shum&#xeb; mjek&#xeb; p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; cil&#xeb;t duhet t&#xeb; flasim me respekt, pasi me pun&#xeb;n dhe kujdesin q&#xeb; tregojn&#xeb;, jan&#xeb; gjithmon&#xeb; n&#xeb; sh&#xeb;rbim t&#xeb; popullit.</span>
          </p>
          <p>
            <span data-id="pg077_n0017">Gjithmon&#xeb;, gjyshi &#xeb;sht&#xeb; i gatsh&#xeb;m ta shuaj&#xeb; kureshtjen e Malit p&#xeb;r pyetjet q&#xeb; i b&#xeb;n.</span>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

