    <aside class="mt-8 border-2 border-purple-300 bg-white rounded-none p-5 shadow-sm">
      <p class="adt-body text-neutral-800 leading-relaxed italic">
        <span data-id="pg077_n0020">Vendi yn&#xeb; ka arsim, sh&#xeb;ndet&#xeb;si e ekonomi, duke iu fal&#xeb;nderuar pun&#xeb;s s&#xeb; palodhshme t&#xeb; specialist&#xeb;ve t&#xeb; k&#xeb;tyre fushave, t&#xeb; cil&#xeb;t nuk ndalen asnj&#xeb;her&#xeb; p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; mir&#xeb;n e vendit ton&#xeb;.</span>
        <span data-id="pg077_n0021">Sot, n&#xeb; vendin ton&#xeb;, sa i p&#xeb;rket cil&#xeb;sis&#xeb;, m&#xeb;simdh&#xeb;nia bashk&#xeb;kohore ka dallime t&#xeb; m&#xeb;dha me at&#xeb; tradicionale.</span>
        <span data-id="pg077_n0022">M&#xeb;suesit luajn&#xeb; nj&#xeb; rol shum&#xeb; t&#xeb; r&#xeb;nd&#xeb;sish&#xeb;m p&#xeb;r arsimin e vendit ton&#xeb;.</span>
        <span data-id="pg077_n0023">Mjek&#xeb;t jan&#xeb; t&#xeb; kualifikuar dhe t&#xeb; specializuar n&#xeb; drejtime t&#xeb; ndryshme.</span>
        <span data-id="pg077_n0024">P&#xeb;r dallim nga mjek&#xeb;t e dikursh&#xeb;m, sot ata shkollohen n&#xeb; vendin ton&#xeb;.</span>
        <span data-id="pg077_n0025">P&#xeb;r zhvillimin e vendit ndihmojn&#xeb; edhe ekonomist&#xeb;t, t&#xeb; cil&#xeb;t punojn&#xeb; q&#xeb; t&#xeb; kemi nj&#xeb; jet&#xeb; m&#xeb; t&#xeb; mir&#xeb;.</span>
      </p>
